<p><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt">NECINA Chairman Cheng Wu Was Awarded as Top
Leader in the MASS Communications Industry:<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></b></p>
<p><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt">&nbsp;<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></b></p>
