<p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Verdana">Honorees
included: in back row, from left, Joseph Goldstein, UMass Amherst; Hiawatha
Bray, Boston Globe; Mark Sternman, representing Sen. John Kerry; Michael Zak,
Charles River Ventures; and Jim Lane, Telica. In front row, from left, are Jim
Kurose, UMass Amherst; Jim Dolce, Unisphere Networks; Kurt Melden, Unisphere;
Frank Heart and Bob Metcalfe, hall of fame inductees; and Cheng Wu, Acopia
Networks.<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
